        <mxCell id="note_v11" parent="lane3" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;v1.1 (integration, 2026-10-11)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• R6_SPARSE added after R6_DISPUTE (ADR-0008): community paths (ρ ≥ 0.3) keep a sparse history out of INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE.&lt;br&gt;• R2 = level 4, corroborated (ADR-0007).&lt;br&gt;• R1 (open dispute) reaches the lender as ACTIVE_DISPUTE; the request is not held and DISPUTED is not entered (D12).&lt;br&gt;• The lifecycle holds a request exactly when the result has a hold reason (R2, R4)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#C9A227;spacing=6;rounded=1;">
